  "notes": "Event is a repeat degradation of the same embedded flaw seal weld repair on CRDM Penetration 69 at Braidwood Unit 1, with four prior LERs cited (2012, 2013, 2015, 2016). No component failed to function; no actual leakage occurred; reportability is based on seriously-degraded principal safety barrier criterion. Component nomenclature 'Reactor Vessel Integrated Head Package Termination' (1718E72) modeled as a Component per block 13 rather than duplicated separately from the penetration weld repair, since narrative treats the weld repair itself as the site of indications. No backups modeled since RCS pressure boundary integrity issue has no operable-backup-system context stated in narrative."
